is a horror themed VR fan game inspired by Hand Movement unique locomotion. Step into a twisted laboratory where failed experiments roam the shadows. Using your arms to climb, run, and escape, you must survive terrifying encounters in a world built to test your nerves.\n\n\ud83e\udddf Features:\n\u2022 Horror Atmosphere Dark, creepy environments filled with unsettling sounds.\n\u2022 Tag with a Twist The classic Hand movement, but now survival means staying out of reach of the monsters.\n\u2022 Multiplayer Suspense Scream and laugh with friends as you try to escape together.\n\u2022 Dynamic Locomotion Climb walls, swing across obstacles, and use every surface to your advantage.\n\nApe Lab mixes the fun of \u201cBeing An Ape\u201d with the fear of survival horror. Whether you\u2019re exploring alone or with friends, the question is simple: how long can you last before the lab takes you?", "short_description": "Enter the lab\u2026 if you dare. Ape Lab is a horror VR fan game inspired by Gorilla Tag, where terrifying experiments lurk in the dark. Run, climb, and survive  but don\u2019t get caught."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/ape-lab-vr/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ape-Games Studio / Brianzo", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/ape-lab-vr/home-page", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "s